meta {
  name: HospitalApi - Auth - Signin (Doctor)
}

env {
  baseUrl = "http://localhost:3000"
}

### Sign In Doctor
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test.doctor@example.com",
  "password": "password1"
}

# Notes:
# - Doctor accounts usually created via `/auth/signup/doctor` which requires ADMIN role.
# - Capture `data.accessToken` from the response and use it for protected routes.
